# FOR THE LOCAL / CI STACK ONLY. These are throwaway, non-secret values used by `supabase functions serve`
# and by the integration test in CI. Never use them for a real project: production sets its own
# AUTH_DERIVE_SECRET (at least 32 random bytes) and APP_ORIGIN as Supabase function secrets.
AUTH_DERIVE_SECRET=ci-only-throwaway-derive-secret-0123456789abcdef-never-for-a-real-project
APP_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3000
